This directory contains all of material prepared by the TAs, including
recitations, and C and Linux boot camps. 

* Recitations start week 3 and are held each Monday through week 15.

* Each recitation must have a source pptx file and the corresponding
  pdf file. Use the following naming convention for recitations: 
  {rec03, rec04, ..., rec15}.{pptx, pdf}

* If you want to tweak the default recitation slides for week k, k=03,
  04..., use the following naming convention: 
  rec<k>-<your AndrewID>.{pptx,pdf}
  

Files:
    c_boot_camp.{pptx,pdf}     Slides for C boot camp  
    c_boot_camp/               Code and puzzles for C boot camp
    linux_boot_camp.{pptx,pdf} Slides for Linux boot camp


